  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing the cost of remittances to the Pacific 2020 to 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment aims to create a more open, competitive and safe financial channel and lower the cost remittances from Australia to the Pacific through a suite of activities. Funding will be provided to support activities with Australian government and non-government partners to deepen relationships between Australian and Pacific financial regulators and institutions, lift capability of those institutions and support activities which address the high cost of remittances from Australia to the Pacific, including through transparency and consumer empowerment initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
